opment decisions. We seek to advance product candidates in therapeutic areas where there remains meaningful unmet medical need and where, if clinical benefit is demonstrated, there may be potential for commercial relevance.","context":"We are a clinical-stage biotechnology company developing novel and differentiated medicines for patients with autoimmune and inflammatory diseases, including serious and debilitating conditions with significant unmet medical need. These diseases are often chronic, biologically complex and difficult to treat, and many patients do not achieve durable disease control with currently available therapies.","section":"ITEM 1. BUSINESS","block":114,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-032080","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-19","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001855644","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1855644/000110465926032080/zura-20251231x10k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/7e4705f816ff5c8ebb8ab520a3318ef9d69191d05edda626094c8a777112a3f6.bin","sha256":"7e4705f816ff5c8ebb8ab520a3318ef9d69191d05edda626094c8a777112a3f6"}},{"id":"d2b3f86a208693129bf09c15194605da6e9ec483a3aba48ad8d1bf31037a7e5a","quote":"We have in-licensed three clinical-stage product candidates:","context":"Our strategy is to identify immune-mediated diseases in which translational and clinical evidence supports the role of specific biological pathways in disease pathogenesis. We focus on targets for which human data, including biomarker findings, genetic associations and prior clinical studies, inform therapeutic rationale and development decisions. We seek to advance product candidates in therapeutic areas where there remains meaningful unmet medical need and where, if clinical benefit is demonstrated, there may be potential for commercial relevance.","section":"ITEM 1. BUSINESS","block":115,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"so