s, such as a business combination that diverts resources or creates competing priorities;","section":"International trade policies, including tariffs, sanctions and trade barriers may adversely affect our business, financial condition, results of operations and prospects.","block":832,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-032080","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-19","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001855644","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1855644/000110465926032080/zura-20251231x10k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/7e4705f816ff5c8ebb8ab520a3318ef9d69191d05edda626094c8a777112a3f6.bin","sha256":"7e4705f816ff5c8ebb8ab520a3318ef9d69191d05edda626094c8a777112a3f6"}},{"id":"f4a0ed491c0a9047b7fe18e006604b143c0f8dafbc5f936ac4031a74ff4fd1d9","quote":"●collaborators could independently develop, or develop with third parties, products that compete directly or indirectly with our product candidates;","context":"●collaborators may delay clinical trials, provide insufficient funding for a clinical trial, stop a clinical trial, abandon a product candidate, repeat or conduct new clinical trials or require a new formulation of a product candidate for clinical testing;","section":"International trade policies, including tariffs, sanctions and trade barriers may adversely affect our business, financial condition, results of operations and prospects.","block":833,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-032080","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-19","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001855644","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1855644/000110465926032080/zura-20251231x10k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/7e4705f816ff5c8ebb8ab520a3318ef9d69191d05edda626094c8a777112a3f6.bin","sha256":"7e4705f816ff5c8ebb8ab520a3318ef9d69191d05edda626094c8a777112a3f6"}},{"id":"51f196ea632cd02fcd13ea2e38d